WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.930
- (sigh) Sunday Sunday Sunday:

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:06.795
The one day of the week I
can finally get (beep) done.

00:00:06.795 --> 00:00:08.051
I even made a list already.

00:00:08.051 --> 00:00:09.061
I can do the laundry.

00:00:09.061 --> 00:00:10.303
I can get groceries.

00:00:10.303 --> 00:00:12.038
I can finally call my grandma back.

00:00:12.038 --> 00:00:13.519
No it's Kenny your grandson.

00:00:13.519 --> 00:00:14.646
Can clean my apartment.

00:00:14.646 --> 00:00:16.884
I can finally finish
that book I'm writing.

00:00:16.884 --> 00:00:18.895
And there's nothing
standing in my way today.

00:00:18.895 --> 00:00:22.448
No commitments. Just pure
blissful productivity.

00:00:22.448 --> 00:00:24.586
(phone vibrating)

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.076
- [Woman] Is that the
shirt you're wearing?

00:00:33.076 --> 00:00:34.043
- [Man] Too long (mumbling) read.

00:00:34.043 --> 00:00:34.868
- [Man] 40 dollars?
- [Man] Yes, because I like

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:35.703
this shirt.

00:00:35.703 --> 00:00:37.536
(chaotic audio sounds)

00:00:37.536 --> 00:00:39.255
- [Woman] I wanna do what I wanna do.

00:00:39.255 --> 00:00:41.883
- Alright. Time to start the day.

00:00:45.302 --> 00:00:46.728
Da! Not again!

00:00:46.728 --> 00:00:51.728
(lighthearted music)

